<title>COSTA RICA: SOCCER-COSTA RICA BEAT GUATEMALA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-COSTA RICA BEAT GUATEMALA 3-0 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE 1996-11-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Costa Rica beat Guatemala 3-0</p>
<p>(halftime 0-0) in a CONCACAF semi-final stage group one World</p>
<p>Cup qualifying match on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scorers: Javier Delgado (53), Hernan Medford (74), Ronald</p>
<p>Gomez (77)</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> United States	2  2  0  0  4  0  6</p>
<p> Costa Rica	   2  2  0  0  4  0  6</p>
<p> Trinidad	     3  0  1  2  1  4  1</p>
<p> Guatemala	    3  0  1  2  1  6  1</p>
<p>Note: top two teams qualify for the six-team final stage of</p>
<p>the CONCACAF World Cup qualifying tournament.</p>
</text>
